---
layout: base.njk
---
{% from "tags.njk" import tag %}
{% from "icon.njk" import icon %}
<section class="profile" aria-labelledby="who-and-why">
  <h2 id="who-and-why">Who and Why am I here?</h2>
  <p>제 소개와 연락처입니다. 각 페이지 맨 아래에 <span class="inline-emoji">❤️</span> 또는 댓글 한마디 남겨주심 그저 좋아라~ 합니다.</p>
  <div class="profile-columns"><ul class="profile-links">
    <li><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/anyflow/">Linkedin</a> / <a href="https://github.com/anyflow">Github</a></li>
    <li><a href="https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC0upJ_e63Eq3_AfJ4Vw0FGw">Youtube</a> / <a href="https://www.strava.com/athletes/57404417">Strava</a></li>
    <li><code>anyflow@gmail·com</code></li>
  </ul><a class="bookmark" href="/introspective-life/anyway" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><div><span>어쨌건간에</span><small>{{ icon(home) }} https://www.anyflow.net/introspective-life/anyway</small></div>{% if home.cover %}<img src="{{ home.cover | escape }}" alt="">{% endif %}</a></div>
</section>
<section class="recent" aria-labelledby="recent"><h2 id="recent">Recent Posts</h2>
  <div class="card-grid" id="recent-cards">{% for item in posts %}<article class="card" {% if loop.index>10 %}hidden{% endif %}>
    {% if item.thumbnail %}<div class="card-preview"><img src="{{ item.thumbnail | escape }}" alt="" loading="lazy"></div>{% elif item.thumbnailDiagram %}<div class="card-preview diagram-preview" aria-hidden="true"><pre class="mermaid">{{ item.thumbnailDiagram | escape }}</pre></div>{% else %}<div class="card-preview text-preview" aria-hidden="true">{{ item.preview | safe }}</div>{% endif %}
    <div class="card-body"><h3 class="card-title"><a class="card-link" href="{{ item.url }}">{{ icon(item) }} {{ item.title | escape }}</a></h3><div class="card-category">{{ tag(item.category,item.tagStyles) }}</div><div class="card-tags">{% for name in item.tags %}{{ tag(name,item.tagStyles,true) }}{% endfor %}</div><time datetime="{{ item.date }}">{{ item.displayDate }}</time></div>
  </article>{% endfor %}</div>
  {% if posts.length>10 %}<button class="load-more" data-load-more="recent-cards" type="button"><svg viewBox="0 0 30 30" aria-hidden="true"><polygon points="24.594 16.594 16 25.188 16 1 14 1 14 25.188 5.406 16.594 4 18 15 29 26 18"></polygon></svg><span>Load more</span></button>{% endif %}
</section>
<section class="category-section" aria-labelledby="by-category"><h2 id="by-category">By Category</h2>
{% for group in categories %}<details class="category-group" data-category="{{ group.name | escape }}" open><summary><span class="category-label">{{ group.name | escape }}</span> <span class="category-count">{{ group.posts.length }}</span></summary><div id="category-{{ loop.index }}">{% for item in group.posts %}<a class="category-row" href="{{ item.url }}" {% if loop.index>10 %}hidden{% endif %}>{{ icon(item) }}<span class="row-title">{{ item.title | escape }}</span><time datetime="{{ item.date }}">{{ item.displayDate }}</time></a>{% endfor %}</div>{% if group.posts.length>10 %}<button class="load-more" data-load-more="category-{{ loop.index }}" type="button"><svg viewBox="0 0 30 30" aria-hidden="true"><polygon points="24.594 16.594 16 25.188 16 1 14 1 14 25.188 5.406 16.594 4 18 15 29 26 18"></polygon></svg><span>Load more</span></button>{% endif %}</details>{% endfor %}
</section>

<section id="comments" class="comments" data-post-id="{{ home.id | escape }}" data-pagefind-ignore aria-labelledby="comments-title">
  <h2 id="comments-title">Comments</h2>
  <noscript>댓글을 보려면 JavaScript를 켜 주세요.</noscript>
</section>
